   Files     : 12 / 12 translated
   Auto-fixed: 2 (needed retries)
   Manifests : 1 translated

   📁 Output : /home/user/my-ts-app_python
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════

  📄 Report saved → translation_report.md  +  translation_report.json
```

